Implement “Practice Ground” in Alva

Work in the hiyroscript/alva repository on the current main branch.

Implement a new Practice Ground experience that replaces the currently disabled Help & Credits home-menu entry.

Do not redesign Alva’s overall architecture or visual identity. Build this feature using the existing vanilla JavaScript, Canvas 2D, screen manager, fighter systems, stage renderer, menu navigation, touch controls, glass UI, and character data.

The result must feel like a first-class Alva mode, not a prototype bolted onto the game.

