This is important: do not solve this by creating an invisible CPU, hidden fighter, stationary dummy, or off-screen TrainingAIController.

There must genuinely be only one fighter in the practice simulation.

Do not instantiate TrainingAIController.

Practice Ground should contain:

* one Fighter
* a PlayerController
* the normal stage collision system
