The fighter should have no opponent unless a future feature adds one.

Audit moves that normally reference an opponent or target. In a no-opponent practice session they must fail gracefully or simply miss; they must never throw an exception.

Do not render:

* a CPU character
* CPU shadow
* CPU ground marker
* CPU HUD
* CPU health
