The feature is complete when this exact flow works:

Home → Practice Ground

The training stage appears immediately with #0001 and no CPU.

The player can freely:

* move
* run
* jump
* charge
* dodge
* use attacks
* use projectiles
* use clone/charged techniques without crashes

